    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Feature Description\n\nThe button `Generate random NoSpam` tooltip includes the same information as the label next to it AND some important bits that could be moved to the label for better visibility. More context [here](/TokTok/qTox/issues/497#issuecomment-2646299674) and [here (scroll down to \"NoSpam UX\" section)](/TokTok/qTox/issues/497#issuecomment-2645812774)\n\n### Contribution\n\n- [ ] I would like to contribute to this feature",
